B. Mathematical formulas Let: [ Z_1=a+jb,\quad Z_2=c+jd ]

Addition: [ Z_1+Z_2=(a+c)+j(b+d) ]

Subtraction: [ Z_1-Z_2=(a-c)+j(b-d) ]

Multiplication: [ Z_1Z_2=(ac-bd)+j(ad+bc) ]

Division: [ \frac{Z_1}{Z_2}= \frac{(ac+bd)+j(bc-ad)}{c^2+d^2} ]

Magnitude: [ |Z|=\sqrt{a^2+b^2} ]

Parallel impedance: [ Z_p=\frac{Z_1Z_2}{Z_1+Z_2} ]

